<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns 'Aaa' to Kansai Electric's notes.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns 'Aaa' to Kansai Electric's notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday it had assigned an Aaa rating to Kansai Electric Power Co Inc's $500 million worth of 7.25 percent notes due to mature in 2006.</p>
<p>Moody's based its rating on Kansai Electric's importance to the Japanese economy and its extremely favourable industry operating environment.</p>
